{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2023-03-14 19:00:00', 'title': 'VENTAS DECLARES FIRST QUARTER 2023 DIVIDEND OF $0.45 PER COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.45 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE IN CASH ON APRIL 13, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 3, 2023. ABOUT VENTAS VENTAS INC., AN S&P 500 COMPANY, OPERATES AT THE INTERSECTION OF TWO LARGE AND DYNAMIC INDUSTRIES – HEALTHCARE AND REAL ESTATE.'}